# EnergyPlus runtime — fetched by scripts/fetch_engine.sh or the Dockerfile.
# Hundreds of megabytes of binaries; never commit it.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing: `engine/` with no slash matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# server/app/engine/ (jobs.py, results.py, worker.py) and shipped an image
# that failed at import.
/engine/

# Python
server/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Runtime state: generated models, EnergyPlus output, uploaded EPW/CSV assets.
server/var/

# Node / build output
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
